{"availability":"available","full":"chenzifeng/cpp2il.com","name":"cpp2il.com","description":"Unity CPP2IL is a reverse-engineering platform for Unity IL2CPP. It processes APK, IPA, WASM, ELF, and Mach-O packages — extracting metadata, rebuilding type hierarchies, restoring call graphs and control flow, then decompiles to readable C# with a traceable IR pipeline. Designed for game security research, code auditing, and compatibility analysis","category":"Design","language":"HTML","stars":3,"forks":0,"created":"2026-06-27T15:57:10Z","updated":"2026-10-11T07:17:19Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://chenzifeng.github.io/cpp2il.com/","topics":[],"demo":"https://chenzifeng.github.io/cpp2il.com/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:41.655Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:41.655Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:41.655Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T07:26:41.655Z","stars":3,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Unity CPP2IL is a reverse-engineering platform for Unity IL2CPP. It processes APK, IPA, WASM, ELF, and Mach-O packages — extracting metadata, rebuilding type hierarchies, restoring call graphs and control flow, then decompiles to readable C# with a traceable IR pipeline. Designed for game security research, code auditing, and compatibility analysis","Unity CPP2IL is a reverse analysis and C# code restoration platform for Unity IL2CPP projects.","The Unity engine uses IL2CPP (Intermediate Language To C++) technology to compile C# code into C++, which is then compiled into machine code by the platform's native compiler. This process loses original type information, generic parameters, delegate relationships, and high-level control flow structures. CPP2IL aims to recover as much of this information as possible from the compiled output, delivering readable and traceable C# code along with structured analysis reports."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/chenzifeng/cpp2il.c